      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "VIEWING MONDAY 5th OCT 2026 @ 1pm - 1:20pm\r\nTEXT SIOBHÁN 0872737812 \r\n\r\nWelcome to 14 South Avenue, an exceptional semi-detached family home set on this prestigious road in Mount Merrion—one of Dublin’s most sought-after residential locations. Beautifully refurbished by the current owners, the property offers a refined blend of space, light, and modern design, resulting in a home of genuine quality and style.\r\n\r\nExtending to a generous footprint, the accommodation is thoughtfully laid out to suit contemporary family living. At its heart is a striking open-plan kitchen, living, and dining area to the rear, flooded with natural light and overlooking the south-west facing garden. This orientation ensures long, sun-filled evenings and creates a seamless connection between indoor and outdoor space—perfect for both everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises an elegant entrance hallway, a formal living room, and the expansive open-plan kitchen/dining/family area. A separate home office, utility room, and guest WC complete a practical and well-balanced layout.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three spacious bedrooms and a contemporary family bathroom, all finished to a high standard. A cleverly designed attic conversion further enhances the accommodation, providing a versatile additional room with ensuite and attractive views over the rear garden. This space is ideally suited as a principal bedroom, guest suite, or another private home office.\r\n\r\nA more ideal location would be difficult to find. While Mount Merrion offers a serene and peaceful lifestyle it is also conveniently located with a host of amenities closeby. Stillorgan, Blackrock and Dundrum centers are all nearby where you can enjoy fine dining, shopping and leisure activities. The Luas at Kilmacud is within easy walking distance. There is excellent public transport complemented by the N11 & M50 being nearby allowing easy access to the city centre and all national routes. \r\n\r\nThere is a range of excellent educational facilities within walking/cycling distance, to include Scoil San Treasa, Mount Anville Primary/Secondary, Colaiste Iosagain/Colaiste Eoin, The Teresian School and Blackrock College are all nearby. UCD is also walkable.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing of this premier Mount Merrion home is highly recommended."
      },
      {
