        "Content": "Beautifully refurbished semi-detached home in prime Mount Merrion\r\nBright open-plan kitchen/dining\r\nSouth-west garden\r\nThree spacious bedrooms plus attic conversion with ensuite\r\nThree new SONAS bathrooms\r\nWired for EV Charger\r\nNew boiler\r\nExcellent transport links including LUAS, N11 and M50 access\r\nIdeally positioned close to some of South Dublin's most highly regarded primary and secondary schools, as well as University College Dublin (UCD)."
